    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"memo\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4dd\" role=\"img\" title=\"memo\">:memo:</span> rvolosatovs submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14743#pullrequestreview-5532831450\">PR review</a>.</p>",
