    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14743#discussion_r4282748207\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So I guess one difference here is that the guest can't cancel the io by dropping the response body anymore, right?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Sort of, and I think that's the expected behavior: if a guest calls <code>send</code>/<code>handle</code> and drops the response, IMO it'd still expect the request body to be transmitted, not aborted. The default implementation uses HTTP/1 with hyper and the hyper future will not resolve until all buffered bytes have been flushed. Ultimately, dropping the response body <em>would</em>, in fact, cancel I/O once the flush completes. A server, which does not read request body would keep the I/O pending. I tested with this example:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">http_body_util</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">channel</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Channel</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hyper</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Bytes</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hyper</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">http1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Duration</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tokio</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">io</span><span class=\"p\">::{</span><span class=\"n\">AsyncWriteExt</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sink</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tokio</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">net</span><span class=\"p\">::{</span><span class=\"n\">TcpListener</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TcpStream</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tokio</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">sync</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">oneshot</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"cp\">#[tokio::main]</span>\n<span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">listener</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TcpListener</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">bind</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"127.0.0.1:0\"</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">addr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">listener</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">local_addr</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dropped_tx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dropped_rx</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">oneshot</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">channel</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">server</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tokio</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">spawn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">move</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">listener</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">accept</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">readable</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">write_all</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">b\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span><span class=\"se\">\\r\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">write_all</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">b\"transfer-encoding: chunked</span><span class=\"se\">\\r\\n\\r\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">await</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">dropped_rx</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"fm\">println!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"server: response dropped, reading request\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sink</span><span class=\"p\">()).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"fm\">println!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"server: connection closed after receiving {n:?} bytes\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TcpStream</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">connect</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">addr</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">io</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hyper_util</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">rt</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">TokioIo</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stream</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sender</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">http1</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">handshake</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">io</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tokio</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">spawn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">body_tx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Channel</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">Bytes</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">req</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hyper</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Request</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"/\"</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">res</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sender</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send_request</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">req</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">upload</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tokio</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">spawn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">move</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">body_tx</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send_data</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"fm\">vec!</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mh\">0xff</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mh\">0xffff</span><span class=\"p\">].</span><span class=\"n\">into</span><span class=\"p\">()).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_err</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"fm\">println!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"client: upload aborted after {i} buffers\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">});</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">tokio</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">sleep</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Duration</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">from_secs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"fm\">println!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"client: upload stalled: {}\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"n\">upload</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_finished</span><span class=\"p\">());</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nb\">drop</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">res</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">dropped_tx</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(()).</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">res</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tokio</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Duration</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">from_secs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conn</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"fm\">println!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"client: connection resolved: {res:?}\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">upload</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">server</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unwrap</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Dropping the store would abort the transmit immediately.</p>\n<p>IMO embedders that want to tighten this, e.g. ensure that the I/O is done within a timeout would implement a custom <code>send_request</code>, e.g. by potentially wrapping the <code>default_send_request</code> and wrapping the returned future (<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/b140c545f5e5523fed8ee42a6166b1fa04d39b31/crates/wasi-http/src/ctx.rs#L259\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/b140c545f5e5523fed8ee42a6166b1fa04d39b31/crates/wasi-http/src/ctx.rs#L259</a>) with a timeout.<br>\nIn fact, how about we provide such wrapper for <code>send_request</code>? (like #14633) Perhaps we could even provide a trait and <code>with_flush_timeout</code> method, such that embedders could do something like:</p>\n<p><div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">fn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">send_request</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">req</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"n\">default_send_request</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">req</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">with_flush_timeout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Duration</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">from_secs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div><br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631932259,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792066070
    },
