        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> adamrk created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14743#discussion_r4284490622\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Regarding cancellation by dropping the body: I guess the WASI spec doesn't say anything about dropping cancelling the operation, so we should probably keep it as you have here. </p>\n<p>Regarding the wrapper: I think it could make sense, but not sure anyone really needs it for now. The main concern was the DOS potential so I'd say we put this in as-is and then do something like the wrapper if it comes up again.</p>\n</blockquote>",
